      <section id="sec_d179e7">
         <ul>
            <li>
               <p>This section describes the motor condition mode of the SMS.</p>
               <p>After Normal Operation Mode is established, motor condition mode analyses the deviation from the baseline model to generate the status of the motor. Motor conditioning status is rated on a 1-10 scale.</p>
            </li>
         </ul>
