         <ul>
            <li>
               <p>The ADI OtoSense™ SMS REST API include status and state properties which are fundamental for understanding motor condition mode:</p>
            </li>
            <li>
               <p>status- indicates the overall connection status of the motor; online or disconnected, and last online datetime.</p>
               <p>state- indicates the component with the most severe fault i.e. the lowest Fault Score Index (FSI) value. For example, if a motor has multiple components with faults, one an Alarm and another a Warning, the state property of the motor object's status will indicate alarm.</p>
            </li>
            <li>
               <p>For more information on the component code and the motor log refer to <xref href="../motor_object/motor_object.dita" format="dita">Motor Object</xref>.</p>
            </li>
         </ul>
